{
  "name": "Page change alert (QuanticData)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Page change alert\nEvery 6 hours, scrapes each page to Markdown (links stripped to reduce noise), hashes the text, compares it with the previous run and posts a message to a webhook when a page changed. The first run only records a baseline.\n\n## Setup\n1. Create an API key on the QuanticData dashboard (API keys page).\n2. In n8n: Credentials > New > **Header Auth**. Name: `QuanticData API`, header name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_KEY`.\n3. Open each orange HTTP Request node and pick that credential.\n4. Edit **Settings** (pages, webhook URL).\n5. Activate the workflow: the hashes are kept in the workflow's static data, which n8n saves only for active (scheduled) runs.\n\nBilled per successful page: https://quanticdata.io/pricing/",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "c668f3e2-981e-4a7c-a1bb-c33f582b9149"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every 6 hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "id": "a9236743-08a4-499c-a403-30b16b9ae269"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1cbd86a2-72c9-45cc-a269-f3e6009ca94d",
              "name": "pages",
              "value": "={{ [{ name: 'Example Domain', url: 'https://example.com/' }, { name: 'Books to Scrape: A Light in the Attic', url: 'https://books.toscrape.com/catalogue/a-light-in-the-attic_1000/index.html' }] }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "4c74c42e-88e5-47a8-a8df-2b37b4985054",
              "name": "alertWebhookUrl",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ],
      "id": "1e7c53cd-9bf0-47bc-a0f3-a9a2d1501912"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "pages",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "One item per page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ],
      "id": "f489676f-201d-4fae-a06e-87b8cd19350d"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.quanticdata.io/v1/scraper/extract",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"url\": \"{{ $json.url }}\",\n  \"format\": \"markdown\",\n  \"contentMode\": \"smart\",\n  \"links_mode\": \"strip\",\n  \"images_mode\": \"strip\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000,
          "batching": {
            "batch": {
              "batchSize": 1,
              "batchInterval": 1000
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Scrape page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        100
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "id": "cbeca70a-25dc-4e0c-a367-1d995c4eb48f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// FNV-1a 32-bit hash: enough to notice a change, no crypto module needed\nfunction fnv1a(text) {\n  let h = 0x811c9dc5;\n  for (let i = 0; i < text.length; i++) {\n    h ^= text.charCodeAt(i);\n    h = Math.imul(h, 0x01000193) >>> 0;\n  }\n  return h.toString(16).padStart(8, '0');\n}\n\nconst pages = $('One item per page').all();\nconst store = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nstore.pages = store.pages || {};\n\nreturn $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  const target = pages[i].json;\n  const page = item.json.payload;\n  const hash = fnv1a(page.content || '');\n  const before = store.pages[target.url];\n  store.pages[target.url] = { hash, checkedAt: new Date().toISOString() };\n  const changed = Boolean(before) && before.hash !== hash;\n  return {\n    json: {\n      name: target.name,\n      url: target.url,\n      status: page.status,\n      hash,\n      previous_hash: before ? before.hash : null,\n      changed,\n      message: changed ? 'Changed: ' + target.name + ' ' + target.url : 'Unchanged: ' + target.name,\n    },\n  };\n});"
      },
      "name": "Compare with last run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        880,
        100
      ],
      "id": "a1aeba8a-9318-405f-aaf8-486634d76aed"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "4b1de006-0af3-42ed-a73e-84a3acf28e91",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.changed && $('Settings').first().json.alertWebhookUrl !== '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Changed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        100
      ],
      "id": "b516bf47-650c-46bb-ab95-6092318ce958"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.alertWebhookUrl }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ text: $json.message }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Send alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        80
      ],
      "id": "a3e33209-06c0-439c-a8ae-387fcec27b2b"
    }
  ],
